<title>THAILAND: Thai balance of payments deficit narrows in March.</title>
<headline>Thai balance of payments deficit narrows in March.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's balance of payments deficit in March narrowed to 700 million baht from a deficit of 26.6 billion baht in February, the central bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The private investment index grew 6.3 percent in February against growth 6.8 percent in January, it added.</p>
</text>
